# Never copied into the Docker image (see Dockerfile). Keeps the build context small and keeps local
# data, secrets and build output out of the image: the image builds everything fresh.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/.env
.git
.github
.claude
DevNotes
apps/server/data
e2e/test-data
e2e/.auth
test-results
playwright-report
